WEBVTT

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:33.190
I'm surprised you could react to that feint.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.730
You could reach Advanced rank soon.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.060
You mean it?!

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.560
Yes!

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.480
How about this?!

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.270
All of these are wrong.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:20.940
What?!

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:31.440
Let the great protection of fire
be on the place thou seekest.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.810
I call the bold heat of a torch here and now.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.020
Fireball.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:46.980
Mother!

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.100
Mother, watch me do magic!

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.520
It's amazing!

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.270
That's a bit frightening.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.350
Don't do anything too dangerous.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.310
Did I do something wrong?

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.990
Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.600
It's done!

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:25.100
Well made, if I do say so myself.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.350
O Goddess.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.100
Coming.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.520
Hello?

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:39.400
Mister Rudeus, it is a pleasure
to make your acquaintance.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.190
My name is Edna Rayrune.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:45.600
I am here to consult with you.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.810
She needs more class time?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:53.190
She does. In half a year,
Lady Eris will be ten years old.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.060
A great party will be held to mark the occasion,

00:02:57.060 --> 00:03:00.310
and nobles from near and far will be invited.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:05.440
The main event of that party will
be a dance performed by Lady Eris.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:10.020
What? Eris, dancing? I'd love to see that.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.480
Oh, excuse me.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:16.150
A noble must be a good dancer.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.060
Lady Eris is learning,

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:24.350
but at this rate, she won't master
basic courtesy, let alone dancing.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.850
I'll bet!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:26.900
You'll what?

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.520
Oh, nothing. Please continue.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.900
Therefore,

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:37.270
I've come to ask if you would be willing
to give me some of your lesson time.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.230
Oh, I see.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.940
If that's what you need, then feel free.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.310
You don't mind?

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:48.190
I want Eris to have good
memories of her birthday.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:58.400
I've got unexpected free time!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.270
Wow.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:05.600
Writing from other continents is over here.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.150
Oh, I can't read it.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:13.060
That's in Beast-God. Does it interest you?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:18.400
I have a bit of free time,
so I'd like to learn another language.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.900
Beast-God is a wonderful language.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:25.060
After all, you can use it to
hire beast people as servants!

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.520
I see. That is attractive.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.730
Oh, do you appreciate their charms as well?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.230
Yes. I've never seen real ones before,

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.650
but I can't get enough of those fluffy ears!

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.440
Yes! I know just what you mean, Rudeus!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.770
I'm especially fond of their tails!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:46.770
When they twitch with emotion, it's just...!

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.770
You really do have Greyrat blood.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:53.690
Lord Philip, I've decided to
study the Beast-God language!

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:57.560
Very well. I give you special
permission to take out books.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.650
May I borrow books in other languages, too?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.480
You may.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.190
Thank you very much.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.060
Ms. Roxy, how are you?

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.560
Let me report:

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:12.060
I've begun studying the
languages of other continents.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:15.150
Beast-God, Battle-God, Demon-God...

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:18.440
There must be a lot more
languages in this world.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.650
This body learns fast,
maybe because it's so young.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:26.400
I should experience lots
of foreign languages now.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.150
No! I can't figure it out at all!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.690
I can ask Ghislaine about Beast-God.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.850
Battle-God is like Human,
so I can kind of manage it, too.

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.940
But Demon-God has me stumped! I don't get it.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.900
That's enough!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.310
Lady Eris!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.100
Eris?

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:55.270
I'm terribly sorry you had to see that.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:56.810
What's wrong?

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:01.270
Lady Eris can't seem to
get the knack of dancing.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.400
You have my sympathy.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.230
At this rate, Lady Eris will
embarrass herself terribly.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:09.100
That's not good.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:15.230
Yes. To be made a laughingstock
on her tenth birthday...

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:19.150
Don't you think it's just too awful?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.730
So, you want me to do something?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.190
Would you to convince Lady Eris for me?

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:28.270
To return to her dancing lessons?

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.900
I figured you'd be here.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.900
Are you having trouble danc--

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:47.560
Ow, ow, ow.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.190
Would you go back to practice?

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.400
I don't need dancing.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.230
But...

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.150
I'll skip the party.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.310
It's your party. You can't skip it.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.560
Why do I have to do things I'm no good at?

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:15.060
I know how she feels.
That's how I ran away in my old life.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:19.230
But I know she'll regret it someday.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:23.020
"If only I'd tried harder back then."

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:27.150
You wouldn't get it, Rudeus.
You can do everything.

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:30.980
There are plenty of things I can't do.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.270
Really?

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:34.230
Really.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:38.940
For example, I started learning
foreign languages recently,

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.940
but I can't make heads or tails of them.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.560
But I'll still keep studying.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.940
Why?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.810
That's a hard question to answer.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:55.230
Maybe because the worse I am at something,

00:07:55.230 --> 00:08:00.150
the better I feel when I work
at it and learn how to do it.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:08.770
Would you give dance practice
another try? I'll help you.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.270
What are you doing?!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.190
Hurry and keep up!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:36.900
Fine. I'll accompany you, My Lady.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.730
Eris! Calm down a little!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.100
I am calm!

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.600
You're going too fast! Stick to the rhythm!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.150
You're just too slow!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.690
What a disaster.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.940
This is worse than I imagined.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:02.020
I don't get it!

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:07.480
Excuse me, Master Rudeus. A package for you.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.190
It's heavy. What could it be?

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:18.770
It's from Roxy! I finally got her answer!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.690
It smells like Roxy.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.770
Dear Rudeus,

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.100
I received your letter.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:36.150
Are you eight already?
I'm sure you must have grown.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.560
You're tutoring the lord
of Fittoa's daughter now?

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:43.270
I can't contain my surprise.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:47.650
And you've also gotten to
know the Sword King Ghislaine.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:50.100
Lift your robe and show me your panties!

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:54.190
Oh, what's become of the little Rudeus
who used to spy on me in the bath?

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:54.190
I'll be real gentle!

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:58.060
You seem so distant now.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:01.810
I still have my hands full with this prince.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:06.560
Hot! Hot!

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:06.560
Now for the issue at hand:
You want to learn the Demon-God language.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:11.730
There are few books in Demon-God,
and its grammar is unique and challenging.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:16.020
So, while it may be presumptuous,
I've made a textbook for you.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.980
I wrote it by hand.

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:22.980
It took a long time to make,
so I hope you take good care of it.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:26.980
If I saw it in a bookshop, I might cry.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:32.520
By the way, His Highness recently
bought a statuette that looks just like me.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:37.310
Its robe is removable, and it even
has moles in the same places.

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:42.100
I may suffer a fatal curse in the near future.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.770
I'm uneasy.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:46.400
If it seems safe, I shall write again.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.400
Roxy.

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:53.230
I didn't think my Roxy figure
would find its way to her.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.100
The prince of Shirone has a good eye.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.520
Handwritten, huh?

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.270
Wow.

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:07.810
I really can't thank Roxy enough.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:13.270
If I ever see her again,
I'll get her to let me lick her feet.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.900
I've got to work hard, too.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:32.310
A-At this rate, you may just manage
to make it through tomorrow.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.560
Really?!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:38.730
Yes. Show the results of your practice
with Mister Rudeus, and you'll be fine.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:43.100
I won't be her partner tomorrow.
Will that be all right?

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:48.560
I-In any case, remember what
we did today and do your best.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:51.060
I know that!

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.350
I'm worried.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.690
Excuse me, is there any rice?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.480
No, of course not. Sorry.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:17.100
Ladies and gentlemen, welcome!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:23.020
Today, my granddaughter Eris is ten years old!

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:27.480
I have prepared delicacies from
every corner of the Asura Kingdom!

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:30.440
Enjoy yourselves thoroughly!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:41.100
Happy birthday, Lady Eris.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.150
Thank you.

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:48.650
Can she stand it?
She won't punch them, will she?

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.480
Mister Rudeus.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:53.480
Oh, Miss Edna. Nice to see you.

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.520
Do you think Lady Eris will be all right?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:00.980
I hope the party ends without incident.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:04.650
Now, let's begin today's main event!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:09.600
If you want my favor,
take my granddaughter's hand!

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.730
May I have this dance?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.600
Yes.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:44.440
M-My Lady, slow down a...

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:51.310
What's wrong, Eris? Stand up!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:54.150
Don't tell me you can't dance!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.480
Ow...

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.980
I see the girl's as stupid as ever.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:04.150
I'd heard she'd improved recently, but...

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.650
She can't even do such a simple dance? Pathetic.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.980
Lady Eris...

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:16.520
The Boreas family is doomed.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.730
May I have this dance?

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.810
Whose boy is that?

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.230
Where's he from?

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:41.400
You've done it now, Rudeus.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.060
Let's dance like we practiced for now.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.810
I know that.

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.850
Let's begin.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:07.560
Eris, don't tell me you're nervous.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:11.270
Grandfather and Father are watching.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.270
Eris...

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:20.270
I'm an amateur at dancing, too,

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.480
but this doesn't require anything too hard.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.690
The problem is...

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:27.560
Eris, close your eyes.

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:28.850
Huh?

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:32.190
I'll cast a charm to make you a good dancer.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.150
There's a spell for that?!

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:36.850
It's not a spell; it's a charm.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:41.850
When I give a signal,
step as if you're dodging an attack.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.150
H-Hey, Rudeus?!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:45.190
Here goes!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.480
Now!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.100
Now!

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:53.770
Now!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.320
Now!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.320
Goodness!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.600
You're doing it, Eris.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.400
Huh?

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:13.270
Do it again just like that.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:15.520
O-Okay.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.060
That's a Greyrat for you!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:56.270
Well done!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:05.400
Mister Rudeus, what in the world...?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:09.350
We learned to deal
with feints in sword training.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.730
Feints?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:15.980
It wasn't that Eris couldn't get
the rhythm; her steps were too quick.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:20.810
So, when she delayed her timing to
avoid falling for a feint, it was perfect.

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:25.230
Oh, I feel as if I've had a revelation!

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:29.520
See?! Rudeus is amazing!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:34.150
You were able to do it because
you worked hard in practice.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.150
Lord Rudeus! Lord Rudeus!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.350
How old are you?

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.900
What do you like?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.520
Rudeus.

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:44.350
I'd rather you didn't stand out too much.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.900
Still, this is a special day, so I'll allow it.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.650
If you take one to bed, use protection.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.850
Huh?

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:03.940
Here you are.

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:05.270
What're those?

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:09.850
According to my master,
magic teachers give their students wands.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:12.810
It's a little late, but please take them.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:13.940
Huh?!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:16.850
I'd rather have one of those!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:20.900
I accept it gratefully, Master Rudeus.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.600
Think nothing of it.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.900
So, you'd rather have one of those, Eris?

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.940
I-I want a wand, too!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.850
Th-Thank you very much.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:42.980
Good. Use it well.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.270
What?

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:49.520
I think she expects a present.

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:51.400
Hmm...

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:57.560
This ring is a talisman
passed down by my people.

00:19:57.560 --> 00:20:02.100
It's said that evil wolves won't
attack you at night when you wear it.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.650
I-I can have it?

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:07.100
Yeah. It was just a superstition, anyway.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.900
I'll treasure it!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:15.690
Sh-She looks happier
than she did for my present.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.480
Well, I guess she is a girl.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:21.900
Oh, Ghislaine, how do you
know it was a superstition?

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.020
Oh,

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.520
I had trouble sleeping that night.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.270
Paul invited me to go for a swim, and--

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.150
Actually, never mind.

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:30.850
I see.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:46.190
Wow.

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:49.480
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:51.650
I'll play a trick on you.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.440
I guess that ring <i>does</i> work.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:19.730
It's early to be going at it like that.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.690
Oh, Rudeus.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:37.650
My apologies, Lord Sauros.
I see I interrupted you.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.600
No matter.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.730
Look at that, Rudeus.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:46.690
He seems different. Did sex mellow him out?

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:47.940
What's that?

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:52.400
I don't know, but it's not a bad thing.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.850
Why do you think so, My Lord?

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:57.810
Because it's better that way.

00:21:57.810 --> 00:21:59.850
I see.

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:04.650
I'll say a prayer, too.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:08.900
May girls rain from the sky.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
Episode 7

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.010
What Lies Beyond Effort

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Next time

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:47.030
Turning Point 1
